# Screenshots taken during design work land in the project ROOT, so only root
# PNGs are ignored. This was `*.png` for a while, which silently excluded every
# brand image in public/images/ - the app referenced files that were never in
# the repository, so a fresh clone rendered with no logo anywhere and no error
# to explain why. Keep this anchored with the leading slash.
/*.png

